  "description": "Loved for its looks and comfort, the Vamoose Sand and Snow Cruiser one of our the most popular categories of our e-bikes.\nSNOW & SAND CRUISERS SO!\nThis Vamoose Cruiser is centered on comfort. With an upright seating position geometry, a super cushy saddle and swept-back handlebars with retro low-slung styling this Vamoose sand and snow Cruiser is synonymous with cool. Cruiser bikes need to be approachable by anyone, which is why you’ll love our step-thru and step over frame design. They also need to be easy to stop and start, so a simple display and a 7-speed shifter fit the bill. Vamoose Cruisers have a geometry that allows riders to touch their feet to the ground when seated. Low and wide that’s the Vamoose ride.\nThis cycle comes standard with the following adders:\n\n• 48V 500W Rear Hub Motor\n\n• 48V 15 Ah Samsung Battery\n\n• CDC6 Active Display\n\n• Cadence sensor\n\n• Front and rear LED lights\n\n• Front and rear fenders\n\n• Rear rack\n\nSPECIFICATIONS\n\nMotor Format:\nSingle Rear\n\nFront Motor:\nN/A\n\nMid Motor:\nN/A\n\nRear Motor:\nBAFANG 52V 500W\n\nDerailleur and shifters:\nSHIMANO ALTUS 7-SPEED\n\nThrottle:\nThrottle w shut off\n\nDisplay:\nCDC6\n\nBattery:\n52V 15Ah Samsung\n\nCharger:\n2.5A\n\nFront forks :\nAluminum\n\nRear Suspension:\nn/a\n\nFrame:\n6061 Aluminum\n\nBrakes:\nTektro Hydraulic E350\n\nWheels:\n26\" X 4\" KENDA MOUTAIN\n\nPedals:\nWellgo\n\nSaddle:\nComfort\n\nFront and Rear Racks:\nRear, with front mount option\n\nFenders:\nPlastic\n\nFront and rear lights:\nLED Wired\n\nADDITIONAL ATTRIBUTES\n\nTorque (per motor):\n80 Nm MAX Torque\n\nWatt Hours:\n910\n\nMiles per charge:\n45.5\n\nKms per charge:\n73.22497\n\nBattery charge time:\n4-6 hrs.\n\nUSB Plugin:\nYES\n\nWEIGHTS AND DIMENSIONS\n\nBox dimensions (cm):\n168 x 31 x 86.5\n\nBox dimensions (inch):\n66 X 12 X 34\n\nWeights (metric):\n35 kg NW / 44 kg GW\n\nWeights (imperial):\n77 lbs NW / 97 lbs GW\n\nMax Speed (metric):\n32 km/h max speed\n\nMax Speed (imperial):\n20 m/h max speed\n\nMax Load:\n330 lbs.",
